        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/rabit/{size}/7330_2.png",
        "created_at": "2013-11-15T16:01:00.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Yeah, I can see the Transformers analogy.</p>\n<aside class=\"quote group-playtesters\" data-username=\"phantaskippy\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/phantaskippy/48/1897_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> phantaskippy:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Man, am I the only one that had Transformers back in the day? (you know, when they were awesome and had metal parts)</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>I generally couldn't afford them when I was a kid (which was when they were awesome and had metal parts  <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/wink.png?v=12\" title=\":wink:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":wink:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"> ). I mostly ended up with… GoBots.  <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/blush.png?v=12\" title=\":blush:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":blush:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"></p>",
