        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote group-playtesters\" data-username=\"Rabit\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/rabit/48/5774_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> Rabit:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Yeah, I can see the Transformers analogy.</p>\n<div><b>phantaskippy wrote:</b><br><blockquote>Man, am I the only one that had Transformers back in the day? (you know, when they were awesome and had metal parts)\n&nbsp;\n</blockquote></div>\nI generally couldn't afford them when I was a kid (which was when they were awesome and had metal parts  :wink: ). I mostly ended up with... GoBots.  :blush: \n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>I feel your pain, I had four and they were from yard sales. &nbsp;</p>",
